          "note": "'knower, witness, judge'; *-dt- > -st- (Boeotian ϝίστωρ)."
        },
        {
          "from": "ποδ- + -σι",
          "to": "ποσσί (Homeric), ποσί (Attic)",
          "note": "dative plural of πούς 'foot'; stem-final δ assimilated to σ."
